{"synopsis":"Bagi Paula, tak ada satu hari pun berlalu tanpa ada yang mengingatkannya akan ketidakcantikannya. Namun, justru wajah jeleknya itulah yang menyelamatkannya dari nasib dijual ke rumah bordil atau mati tragis seperti saudara-saudaranya. Maka, ketika ayah Paula menjualnya untuk bekerja di kediaman seorang bangsawan terhormat, ia menyadari bahwa gadis-gadis desa hanyalah sumber daya yang bisa dibuang begitu saja. Namun, ia menemukan Pangeran Belunita muda yang disembunyikan di sebuah sayap bangunan, malu-malu disembunyikan dari pandangan publik yang penasaran. Dan saat Paula berjuang untuk memenuhi keinginan tuannya yang kejam, ia juga harus menerima perannya sebagai pelayan rahasianya.","alternative_title":"백작가의 비밀스런 시녀님","author":"Baekjua","artist":"Midnight Studio","chapters":[{"number":"100","chapter":"100","slug":"89c7ecfd-e28c-4d6a-a962-b37267d76c11","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2026-08-04"},{"number":"99","chapter":"99","slug":"edea0eb2-0e02-4464-bfd1-ac4ff2defbdc","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-07-27"},{"number":"98","chapter":"98","slug":"128eab4d-2da6-489a-a823-6df5939541df","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"97","chapter":"97","slug":"a398822f-8497-4bc4-b9e1-c58ce4e4d1b7","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"96","chapter":"96","slug":"63d5ba0e-f4e7-4b01-82d1-445e89968b64","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-07-07"},{"number":"95","chapter":"95","slug":"6ec5a7ef-9222-44b1-a9c4-30309493df15","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-07-01"},{"number":"94","chapter":"94","slug":"7c9b385c-afc3-443f-a2ae-bbd30c285f01","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-06-22"},{"number":"93","chapter":"93","slug":"20d2b701-e4da-4bfc-9048-7cc07fe8e685","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-06-17"},{"number":"92","chapter":"92","slug":"8c0bb337-9e3b-47fa-a21a-dd2bcf4d3c1b","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-06-08"},{"number":"91","chapter":"91","slug":"c603aa3d-4484-4dec-aa02-c510eda2c816","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-06-08"},{"number":"90","c